      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `767c87dd85cdc8bc2fe9464fdec5361a8761cf0806dcd9020ac46cd208904399--victims-of-assault-selected-states-and-territories.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2015\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 7ad8efce738f7625e52f441dba6762b7a84f2501f488646904e04698872e8111 | missing |\n| \"Table 31\" | 7d0c08d9fb70635d6abdbde7fe942d30e903f34afab09bebec27031ee5492512 | missing |\n| \"Table 32\" | 71e2e3e1cef6b7d9197e2801f0ee9a351beca3d348e3311c3445ea9d518f2f26 | missing |\n| \"Table 33\" | 197c61b073f1325f50348b31efebc34314e32d6942516dd9e4592ae848221f92 | missing |\n| \"Table 34\" | 1b94a4bb56345431623b141791f23e8329830cef80265263fb731537717c8c34 | missing |\n| \"Table 35\" | 20ede78482934f2ed1dd1cebdca136255f3bf1ecec73ac6160b6d19534c2a65c | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | e6567846409babec05ff990dc9627502838fe0bbbfa995cefc1fac7077e5b4c4 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
